What is a Dynamic Admission Controller?
Uses external webhook
Webhook decides allow/deny/mutate

Explain ValidatingAdmissionWebhook.
------------------------
Sends object to external webhook
Webhook validates request
Returns allow/deny response

Explain MutatingAdmissionWebhook.
-------------------
Modifies object before persistence
Commonly used for:
sidecar injection
labels
annotations
default configs

What happens if Admission Controller fails?
-----------------------------------------
In yml
failurePolicy:
  Ignore | Fail
Ignore → request continues
Fail → request blocked

