Can Admission Controllers authenticate users?
-------------------------------------------
NO, Authentication happens BEFORE admission control.

Can Admission Controllers modify existing objects?
-----------------------------------------------
They modify requests during API operations:

create
update
delete

Not directly editing stored etcd objects.

Do Admission Controllers work for kubectl only?
------------------------------------------

❌ No

They work for ALL API requests:

kubectl
CI/CD
controllers
operators
REST API

